A voice comes from the loudspeaker.
It announces the big station.
I must change trains here.
The U-Bahn stops and I get out.
I must travel with the S-Bahn now.
The station is very big and full.
I see the signs for the S-Bahn.
I walk quickly through the large hall.
Then I go up the stairs.
The platform for the S-Bahn is upstairs.
I already see my S-Bahn.
It is standing at the platform and waiting.
The doors are still open.
I run the last few metres.
I get in quickly with my backpack.
